# Always commit and push

After finishing website or code changes in this repo, commit and push to `origin` immediately. Do not ask first.

- Commit only the relevant files (never `.DS_Store` or secrets)
- Follow existing commit message style (short, why-focused)
- Push `main` after a successful commit
- Skip an empty commit if there is nothing to commit
